THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
----------------------
Dentiva bundles third-party components that are licensed separately under
their own permissive licences (MIT, BSD-3-Clause, Apache-2.0, SIL OFL 1.1).
Those components remain the property of their respective copyright holders
and are redistributed in compliance with their licence terms. The complete
audit — including component names, versions, licences, and the notices that
must accompany redistribution — is maintained in:

  docs/DEPENDENCIES.md

Redistributing a Dentiva build requires including the licence notices listed
in that document (the application also displays them from its About screen and
ships them inside every installer payload as THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt).
